# Play test of Ironreef Caverns (CIPlay ironreef_caverns, in a test world 'CI ...'). Points as in its recipe: the camp
# on the east beach, the Iron Gate 23 m up the south flank, the Vine Crawl east, the Drowned Shaft west, the Bear Hall
# north.
island Ironreef Caverns
expect step 0
expect title The Heart of Ironreef

# Ashore at the mining camp: the company's notice
walk 92 -2 to 84 -2 h=3
zone camp
expect step 1
read Company notice
expect step 2

# Up the plank road onto the mountain's shoulder, along it to the Iron Gate's terrace
walk 74 1 to 71.1 -0.9 to 53.6 -28.6 to 50 -31 to 46 -35 h=20.5
walk 46 -35 to 40 -44 to 32 -52 to 22 -55.5 to 12 -55.5 to 9 -55 h=23.4
zone irongate
expect step 3
expect message grunts at the end
kill Warthog
expect animals Warthog 0

# Into the mine, along the rails to the foreman's desk at the back
walk 9 -55 to 9 -45 to 9 -32 to 8 -23 h=23.6
read Foreman's log
expect step 4
open Foreman's locker
expect item HeadLight 1

# The Vine Crawl: bees, and the powder crate at its end
walk 58 4 to 50 4 to 44 4 to 40.6 4 h=9.9
zone vines
expect message bees
kill Bee swarm
open Powder crate
expect story charges 1

# The Bear Hall's rockfall: shut, and one charge is not enough
walk -4 58 to -4 38 blocked
use rockface
expect message Two blasting charges
expect shown rockfall

# The Drowned Shaft: down to the flooded floor of the adit for the sunken box
at -36 -7.2 h=-2.5
zone drowned
open Sunken powder box
expect story charges 2
expect step 5

# The rockfall blown; into the Bear Hall; Ironhide; the company's strongbox
use rockface
expect message blast shakes
expect story charges 0
expect hidden rockfall
walk -4 58 to -4 44 to -4 32 h=4.6
zone bearhall
expect step 6
kill Bear
expect step 7
expect animals Bear 0
walk -4 32 to -4.5 14 h=6.8
open Company strongbox
expect item Blueprint_TitaniumTools 1
expect done
